# Codex plugins
# Format: plugin@marketplace
# Used by: scripts/install_codex.sh  (dotfiles install --codex)
#
# The same plugins as claude/plugins.list wherever a Codex version exists.
# Claude-only, deliberately absent: recall-skill and sync-claude-sessions-skill
# (personal-os-skills). They ship no Codex plugin and are driven by Claude Code
# hooks, so parity would not mean anything.
#
# Plugin hooks (warp, cc-safety-net) are not trusted on install: open codex,
# run /hooks and press t on each. The installer prints this reminder.
# Private entries go in codex/plugins.local.list (gitignored).

# Official OpenAI curated marketplace; no marketplace add needed. The installer
# falls back to superpowers@openai-curated-remote on a machine where Codex has
# not synced the curated marketplace yet.
superpowers@openai-curated

compound-engineering@compound-engineering-plugin
warp@codex-warp
# Renamed upstream from safety-net.
cc-safety-net@cc-marketplace
